🖼️ Pixel Manipulation for Image Encryption 🔐
A simple yet effective Python GUI tool for encrypting and decrypting images by manipulating their pixel values. This project demonstrates how to implement custom image encryption using pixel-wise operations and a secret key.

📌 Features
📁 Load images from your device

🔐 Encrypt images with a custom numeric key

🔓 Decrypt encrypted images using the same key

💻 User-friendly GUI built using Tkinter

📦 Supports .png, .jpg, .jpeg, and .bmp formats

🛠️ Technologies Used
Python

Tkinter for GUI

Pillow (PIL) for image handling

Custom pixel shifting logic for encryption/decryption

🧠 How It Works
The encryption works by shifting the RGB values of each pixel using a key provided by the user.

The decryption reverses this shift using the same key.

The tool ensures that the original image can be perfectly restored if the correct key is used.

📌 Use Cases
Educational demonstration of image encryption

Basic security layer for storing sensitive images

Digital art experimentation
